--- !u!114 &31241546
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 31241544}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4a1171847eb875841a989d214a1e802a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeTrigger
  dialouge:
    names:
    - ...
    - ...
    - ...
    - ...
    - ...
    sentences:
    - "Tell me something, newest member of the jury, how willing are you to see humans
      apart from their lies? \r\n"
    - 'Will you strip them off their complexity for the sake of command and duty?
      Or will you consider their faults as human error and forgive what cannot be
      undone? '
    - "Welcome to Sheol, the subterranean land of the dead and humanity\u2019s common
      grave. The realm in-between human and divine where stands a courtroom, built
      for the appointed Virtue to pass the divine\u2019s final verdict."
    - 'In here, reality merges between what was and was not. Their stories of life
      and grief exist either in fiction or born from human error. '
    - 'After all, no one is ever the same. '
