--- !u!114 &880410738
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 880410736}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4a1171847eb875841a989d214a1e802a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeTrigger
  dialouge:
    names:
    - ...
    - ...
    - Soul #1
    - ...
    - Middle Man
    - ...
    - Soul #1
    - Soul #1
    - Soul #1
    - Soul #1
    - ...
    - ...
    - ...
    sentences:
    - 'Thus arrives your first defendant, short in their steps as they climb into
      the podium, nervousness radiating from their form. '
    - "You raise your hand to signal them to speak, but at the instance your arm
      moves\u2013they squeak. Unknown to how to treat the fearful, you nod your head
      as a sign for the soul instead. "
    - "Uhm, well\u2026"
    - They stammer, still unsure how to proceed. You urge them, voice dull and lacking
      in concern.
    - 'Speak your truth and why you are here, soul of the once living. Tell me your
      faults and reasons, for your conviction may change the line of your fate. '
    - 'They flinch at the sound of your voice reverbing around the halls, clearly
      uncomfortable by the lonely space you two occupy. To your benefit, they begin
      to speak their testimony. '
    - "Well, I\u2019ll be honest s-sir\u2013ma\u2019am? I\u2019ve been an honest-to-god
      good person all my life. The only thing that I could think of that I ever did
      wrong was\u2026 well\u2026 "
    - "Speed a red light\u2026 "
    - "I swear it was an accident! The lights just suddenly changed before I could
      process the colors change and\u2026!  I paid my fine a-and no one got hurt!  "
    - "Just my pride and my wallet, is all\u2026 "
    - Hm. Interesting.
    - From what you know, the souls of the dead vow to speak the truth and nothing
      but the truth before stepping out of the coffin. This is a binding pact to
      the divine world that prevents them from committing any form of deception.
    - As such, minor as the issue is, the soul must be telling the truth.
