--- !u!114 &1610923316
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1610923314}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4a1171847eb875841a989d214a1e802a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeTrigger
  dialouge:
    names:
    - ...
    - ...
    - ...
    - Middle Man
    - ...
    - Middle Man
    - ...
    - Soul #4
    - Soul #4
    - ...
    - Middle Man
    - Soul #4
    - ...
    sentences:
    - 'Your fourth defendant arrives on edge. Despite their hooded form, you can
      feel the piercing sternness of their gaze as they step forth on the podium.

'
    - 'They stand tall with an unnerving stillness to it. Unlike the previous defendant,
      this one stands with an air of authority, as though you are the powerless between
      the two of you. '
    - Although absurd, you decide to pay no heed to their attitude.
    - "Speak your truth and why you are here, soul of the once living. Tell me your
      faults and reasons, for your conviction may change the line of your fate. \r\n"
    - 'The soul remains silent, as if questioning your right to demand a statement.
      At this, you raise an eyebrow. '
    - 'Well? '
    - 'They huff in response. If this is their way of being difficult, they would
      be mistaken to believe that this will get a rise out of you. '
    - 'I lived a simple life. Married with children of whom I took proper care of.
      I gave them a roof over their heads, food on the table, clothes on their backs,
      and proper education. '
    - " I\u2019ve done what any parent would for their child. I have nothing to repent
      for, nor do I regret anything. Even if my ungrateful children never did anything
      to repay the favor. "
    - Unsatisfied with their testimony, you pry further.
    - 'Nothing? If you did everything to care for them, why would your children evade
      you? '
    - "\u2026I cared for their basic necessities. Anything else would have been pointless.
      I spent my life, money, and hard work to raise them and all I get is their
      thankless attitude. They deserve much less."
    - 'With the venom on their tongue, they sneer at you as if you were one of their
      children. With a soul fueled with so much anger, you decide against pressing
      more questions. '
