  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4a1171847eb875841a989d214a1e802a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeTrigger
  dialouge:
    names:
    - ...
    - ...
    sentences:
    - The cackling mask is of the God of Judgement, who laughs at the face of baseless
      accusations and adds on it. Judgement practices the art of careful accusation,
      the one who draws conclusions based on the situation and mocks the existence
      of one-sided opinions. Often, this God is believed to be ruthless and unforgiving
      for their opinion.
    - "Relentless and stubborn, Judgement\u2019s verdict is what Hell believes is
      absolute. Many believe that it is their mockery that flames the eternal raging
      fire of hell, bringing life to the anger of human kind drawn from their audacious
      accusations towards them."
