  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4a1171847eb875841a989d214a1e802a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeTrigger
  dialouge:
    names:
    - ...
    - ...
    sentences:
    - The weeping mask is of the God of Justice, who speaks only for law and lives
      only by law. Justice believes that all is right and fair only when beneath
      the structure of law, forever mourning those unable or unwilling to follow
      as those only end in persecution. Often, this God is believed to be inconsiderate
      and selfish for their opinion.
    - "Unshakable and determined, Justice\u2019s verdict is what Heaven believes
      is absolute. Many believe that their sorrow was the catalyst for the creation
      of the holy water, with their tears considered as the purest form."
